WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:04.290
Something doesn't feel right.

00:05.170 --> 00:09.040
We made preparations the past two days
just as we were told to.

00:09.750 --> 00:13.250
We never felt a shred of doubt,
and we even forgot our fears.

00:14.420 --> 00:16.330
But that thing...

00:17.210 --> 00:18.830
is beyond gigantic!

00:19.830 --> 00:21.750
Our enemy is massive!

00:21.750 --> 00:24.330
Where did I get the notion

00:24.330 --> 00:28.040
that some backwater, second-rate dragon hunters
like us could hunt this monstrosity?

00:35.540 --> 00:36.750
Damn it!

00:40.750 --> 00:42.790
Don't lose your nerves, guys!

00:42.790 --> 00:44.170
We've got this!

00:44.170 --> 00:47.580
Let's butcher that damn dragon!

00:56.920 --> 00:59.170
You won't get away with this.
I'll have your heads!

00:59.170 --> 01:02.540
I'll absolutely, absolutely, absolutely...

01:02.540 --> 01:04.790
absolutely kill you!

01:04.790 --> 01:07.960
The wind proclaims it so too!

02:39.380 --> 02:43.960
<b>Episode 4: Action</b>

02:39.830 --> 02:43.960
The Tempest Cell's tornado is
twice as fast as this car's top speed.

02:44.380 --> 02:47.750
We'd be ripped to shreds immediately
if we attempted a regular escape.

02:49.630 --> 02:50.630
Tsk!

02:50.960 --> 02:53.330
They're fleeing in the direction of the sun!

02:53.580 --> 02:55.750
Against a superior dragon
in perfect condition,

02:55.750 --> 02:57.710
and the Third Seat to boot,

02:57.710 --> 03:00.790
sunlight is not a definitive attack method.

03:01.330 --> 03:06.710
His defensive and recovery abilities will
exceed any damage caused by the sunlight.

03:06.710 --> 03:09.210
But that being said,
his power will be reduced!

03:09.460 --> 03:10.670
Fire!

03:13.630 --> 03:15.250
What's that sound?

03:19.170 --> 03:20.710
The wind froze!

03:21.080 --> 03:24.420
This is a misconception
even among dragon hunters.

03:24.750 --> 03:28.380
Silverine does not freeze
the blood of a dragon.

03:28.380 --> 03:31.790
It freezes the magic in their blood.

03:32.420 --> 03:36.580
Consequently, when it comes into contact
with wind controlled by magic,

03:36.580 --> 03:38.080
this happens!

03:38.420 --> 03:39.460
It's working!

03:39.460 --> 03:40.710
It's really working!

03:40.710 --> 03:43.670
Was that perhaps a silver bullet just now?

03:44.080 --> 03:47.880
Well, you've procured
a very high-quality item.

03:48.210 --> 03:50.380
That's probably what he's thinking.

03:50.380 --> 03:51.830
It's not that though.

03:52.040 --> 03:54.580
These are just regular lead bullets.

03:54.960 --> 03:59.170
However, they're chock-full
of Ragna's silverine.

03:59.630 --> 04:02.460
But what are you trying to achieve?

04:08.670 --> 04:11.830
Freezing the surface with
these measly attacks

04:11.830 --> 04:14.790
will not shake the bond
between the wind and I!

04:14.790 --> 04:17.080
That's probably what he's thinking.

04:17.080 --> 04:19.040
But this...

04:19.040 --> 04:20.290
is the real deal!

04:20.290 --> 04:21.710
It's your turn now!

04:21.710 --> 04:22.630
Okay!

04:22.630 --> 04:23.880
Eat this!

04:24.330 --> 04:26.790
These bullets are infused
with Ragna's silverine.

04:26.790 --> 04:29.000
What's the difference in power
between these bullets

04:29.000 --> 04:31.210
and the silverine infused
lead bullets from earlier?

04:34.080 --> 04:35.380
It's shaking him up!

04:39.580 --> 04:41.830
It wasn't enough to take out the tornado.

04:42.250 --> 04:43.750
But...

04:45.540 --> 04:47.750
The power increase is immense!

04:48.460 --> 04:49.920
What in the...?

04:49.920 --> 04:51.460
What the hell was that?

04:53.580 --> 04:56.420
My bond with the wind!

04:59.790 --> 05:01.330
It's gotten faster!

05:01.330 --> 05:02.670
That's no problem!

05:02.670 --> 05:04.040
Make him eat bullets!

05:09.630 --> 05:11.250
You'll pay for this.

05:14.880 --> 05:17.460
The very existence of humans is useless!

05:17.460 --> 05:21.330
They're astonishingly weak
and have lower IQs than maggots!

05:21.330 --> 05:23.000
Worthless dragon hunters!

05:25.040 --> 05:26.630
You're dead!

05:28.000 --> 05:31.080
You're dead! You're dead! You're dead!

05:31.250 --> 05:33.880
You're dead! You're dead! You're dead!

05:33.880 --> 05:36.540
There's no way I'd let this slide!

05:36.540 --> 05:39.210
You trash!

05:39.670 --> 05:44.330
You won't get away!

05:53.580 --> 05:56.290
What the hell was that?

06:00.790 --> 06:02.460
Silverine Battle Arts.

06:12.630 --> 06:15.080
What just happened?

06:21.920 --> 06:23.830
Th-the wind!

06:24.500 --> 06:25.580
Damn it!

06:25.580 --> 06:27.920
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

06:28.250 --> 06:31.670
My heart is injured,
which will sever the source of my blood!

06:31.670 --> 06:34.130
The flow of my magic will be stopped!

06:34.880 --> 06:36.080
It's cold!

06:36.290 --> 06:37.670
It's cold!

06:37.670 --> 06:39.250
I can't melt it!

06:39.500 --> 06:42.460
I'm not in command of the wind!

06:42.580 --> 06:46.130
Now, die!

06:54.290 --> 06:55.670
Purun! Purun!

06:55.670 --> 06:58.290
End him, shtupid humansh!

07:15.380 --> 07:17.920
Those worthless dragon hunters...

07:18.580 --> 07:20.790
Can't do this to me!

07:20.790 --> 07:26.290
Not to one such as I!
Not to the Third Seat, Disas Trois!

07:37.670 --> 07:40.330
This must...

07:40.330 --> 07:42.380
be an error.

07:42.670 --> 07:44.960
The wind agrees too.

07:47.420 --> 07:52.500
Disas Trois, the Third Seat of the
Blood of the Wing, was no lightweight.

07:52.920 --> 07:55.460
For instance, if he had transformed
into his dragon form,

07:55.460 --> 07:59.540
he would've been able to summon
up to eight tornados at the same time.

07:59.540 --> 08:05.000
If that happened, my plan
would've fallen to pieces.

08:06.210 --> 08:08.500
But get a load of him now.

08:09.080 --> 08:14.130
He was incapable of imagining himself
being hunted and killed.

08:14.420 --> 08:18.000
I provoked his wrath
and a veritable desire to kill me.

08:18.000 --> 08:20.670
But he didn't try to kill me
with all his power.

08:21.750 --> 08:24.750
Pride and arrogance give rise to negligence.

08:25.130 --> 08:28.330
After sunlight and silverine,

08:28.330 --> 08:31.080
I deem this the third major weakness
of superior dragons.

08:31.540 --> 08:34.460
Nonetheless, to capitalize on this weakness,

08:34.830 --> 08:37.460
I came up with top-notch weapons
for dragon hunting

08:37.460 --> 08:42.290
by putting silverine into normal bullets
and even the terrain itself.

08:42.290 --> 08:48.130
Ragna, you should be grateful
to the Tempest Cell

08:48.130 --> 08:51.420
for letting you demonstrate
your incredible potential.

08:52.290 --> 08:55.330
This is a continuation of the talk
we had yesterday.

08:55.330 --> 09:00.830
Setting aside your abandonment of Leo,
choosing me was the correct choice.

09:00.830 --> 09:03.250
And I'll make sure you recognize that.

09:04.080 --> 09:05.960
He's made that crystal clear.

09:06.540 --> 09:10.380
Crimson probably didn't consider
the battle we just had a battle.

09:10.380 --> 09:12.380
He didn't even consider it a hunt.

09:12.630 --> 09:15.290
He was merely experimenting with me.

09:15.830 --> 09:17.580
This is Crimson.

09:17.580 --> 09:19.790
He knows everything about dragons.

09:19.790 --> 09:21.790
He knows everything necessary
to know to hunt dragons,

09:21.790 --> 09:23.790
from their natures to their powers!

09:24.210 --> 09:26.540
He doesn't need to ask me about the future.

09:26.540 --> 09:29.130
He can foresee that himself.

09:31.380 --> 09:32.710
How nice.

09:33.080 --> 09:35.420
Look at his face.

09:37.500 --> 09:41.130
Once again, I'm starkly reminded
of how remarkable Crimson is.

09:41.130 --> 09:43.170
And how dangerous he is.

09:43.630 --> 09:46.330
Together, we'll massacre dragonkind.

09:47.080 --> 09:50.790
And in the end,
once all the dragons are dead, I'll...

09:54.000 --> 09:55.500
hunt Crimson!

09:57.920 --> 09:59.210
Is this really okay with you?

09:59.630 --> 10:02.750
You're not only giving us food, but you're
giving us weapons and vehicles too?

10:02.750 --> 10:04.210
It's no problem.

10:04.210 --> 10:08.670
I hope you guys will be able to
safely escape the country.

10:08.960 --> 10:10.170
Thank you!

10:10.420 --> 10:11.790
Purururu!

10:11.790 --> 10:14.460
May you shtay in good health,
shtupid humansh!

10:14.460 --> 10:16.920
Will do! Thanks, Mister Slime!

10:17.210 --> 10:19.880
And now, I need you to...

10:21.080 --> 10:22.420
Forget about me.

10:25.670 --> 10:27.920
Well, that's settled now.

10:30.750 --> 10:31.790
Huh?

10:31.790 --> 10:32.830
Eh?

10:33.290 --> 10:34.500
Let's go.

10:35.540 --> 10:37.040
Mr. Reaper!

10:38.210 --> 10:42.380
It's all thanks to you that we were
able to survive and get vengeance.

10:43.040 --> 10:44.250
Thank you.

10:47.880 --> 10:50.210
It wasn't all me.

10:52.290 --> 10:54.330
You guys were the ones who
stood up to the dragon!

10:58.920 --> 11:00.290
In that case,

11:00.290 --> 11:02.920
this was a triumph for all dragon hunters!

11:08.920 --> 11:10.630
Shtay shtrong!

11:10.630 --> 11:11.630
Now then...

11:11.630 --> 11:12.880
Ta-dah!

11:15.420 --> 11:19.040
We have important news for the entire nation.

11:19.040 --> 11:23.040
This is the Lese Royal Army, and we have
an important announcement for all citizens.

11:23.040 --> 11:27.920
Right now, there is a large-scale dragon attack
in progress at a city near the border.

11:27.920 --> 11:32.540
All citizens in every city must obey
army directives and evacuate to the capital.

11:33.080 --> 11:34.710
The royal capital is safe.

11:34.830 --> 11:36.460
The royal capital is safe.

11:36.750 --> 11:41.710
If you are unable to evacuate for some reason,
wait in place for army rescue.

11:41.920 --> 11:45.130
Do not go near the border
under any circumstance.

11:46.420 --> 11:47.880
Whatcha think?

11:47.880 --> 11:48.880
It's a trap.

11:49.540 --> 11:51.830
It's exactly like drive hunting.

11:52.130 --> 11:56.290
They're blocking the escape routes and
corralling the citizens into the capital.

11:58.080 --> 11:59.960
Let's go, Crimson!

12:00.540 --> 12:03.830
Well, it's about time we change
hunting grounds.

12:06.580 --> 12:09.040
Let's set off for the capital!

12:09.170 --> 12:11.130
<b>Five days earlier</b>

12:14.130 --> 12:17.080
Donapierru has been destroyed?

12:17.460 --> 12:22.040
Which country invaded it?
Was it Garness? Or Markt?

12:22.330 --> 12:24.750
Neither of them, Your Majesty.

12:25.040 --> 12:27.290
The city was attacked by dragons.

12:28.500 --> 12:34.290
When the sun set, there was a lightning storm
that reduced the city to ashes.

12:34.290 --> 12:37.380
Almost all the armed forces
stationed there were wiped out.

12:37.380 --> 12:41.290
And after that, a horde of dragons
with many medial dragons arrived.

12:41.290 --> 12:44.080
All communications from the city
have now stopped.

12:44.380 --> 12:48.040
Form a unit from the troops
stationed in Ronabera and Tortiere

12:48.040 --> 12:49.790
and send them as aid.

12:49.790 --> 12:51.080
This is an emergency!

12:51.330 --> 12:54.830
Recruit dragon hunters as troops
so they're placed under military command.

12:54.830 --> 12:59.210
If there are any superior dragons,
do not attack them under any circumstance!

12:59.210 --> 13:00.420
Yes, Your Majesty!

13:02.170 --> 13:03.630
Lightning...

13:03.920 --> 13:06.580
That reminds me of what happened
twenty years ago.

13:06.880 --> 13:10.080
It was the day Garness attacked Donapierru.

13:10.080 --> 13:12.170
Dragons appeared out of nowhere

13:12.170 --> 13:15.250
and decimated the Garnessian Army
with lightning strikes.

13:15.250 --> 13:17.500
They saved our kingdom.

13:17.500 --> 13:18.670
Indeed.

13:18.670 --> 13:23.960
I had hoped that the dragons living in the area
didn't enjoy fighting, by some chance.

13:23.960 --> 13:26.500
But why now?

13:26.880 --> 13:28.920
Did something incur the wrath of the dragons?

13:29.500 --> 13:32.420
But the royal capital is protected by the barrier.

13:32.880 --> 13:37.380
The strength of a single superior dragon
surpasses that of thousands of people.

13:37.380 --> 13:39.580
It's not simple...

13:40.920 --> 13:41.880
Hmm?

13:46.210 --> 13:47.710
What was that?

13:48.380 --> 13:50.210
Something's wrong.

13:52.920 --> 13:54.920
It's too quiet.

14:01.130 --> 14:04.710
We've not yet been acquainted,
King Femud Lese.

14:05.630 --> 14:08.790
Please forgive my unannounced
descent from the heavens.

14:11.380 --> 14:15.000
I am one of those to whom God has
granted the title of "Monarch."

14:15.750 --> 14:18.420
I'm the First Seat of the Blood of the Wing.

14:18.420 --> 14:20.460
You may call me Ultimatia.

14:20.960 --> 14:23.210
The Winged Monarch!

14:23.710 --> 14:25.330
The Angel-Winged Dragon?

14:25.580 --> 14:28.710
Yes, I'm sometimes called by that title.

14:28.710 --> 14:32.830
But really, calling a young girl like me
the Angel-Winged Dragon?

14:33.250 --> 14:36.330
Frankly, I feel intimidated by its grandeur.

14:36.710 --> 14:38.540
What about the barrier?

14:38.790 --> 14:42.750
You're speaking of the Solar Safeguard
engineered by the Solarians, correct?

14:43.420 --> 14:46.670
At night, it emits sunlight
accumulated during the day,

14:46.670 --> 14:49.210
which creates a barrier that
wards off those of my bloodline.

14:49.500 --> 14:52.040
Even at night, the royal capital shines bright.

14:52.040 --> 14:53.750
It's lovely to behold.

14:54.420 --> 14:56.670
Oh, don't be troubled.

14:56.670 --> 14:59.170
The barrier is still fully functional.

14:59.170 --> 15:04.130
Truthfully, I'm just grinning and
bearing the heat now.

15:04.420 --> 15:07.420
It seems like staying too long would be trying.

15:07.420 --> 15:09.170
Grinning and bearing it?

15:09.540 --> 15:12.540
Ultimatia, the Winged Monarch.

15:13.080 --> 15:15.920
In the long-standing war
between humans and dragons,

15:15.920 --> 15:20.920
there is no record of this enigmatic
Dragon Monarch publicly taking action.

15:20.920 --> 15:22.920
But the one thing I do know about her...

15:22.920 --> 15:24.420
Have no fear.

15:24.710 --> 15:29.670
Your vassals cannot move,
but they are unharmed.

15:29.670 --> 15:34.420
I've simply manipulated time
and made the world stand still.

15:35.130 --> 15:38.630
Being a Dragon Monarch,
it would result in a great upset

15:38.630 --> 15:43.960
if I were spotted in the royal capital.

15:43.960 --> 15:48.170
Thus, I've taken the liberty to
appear before you in this manner.

15:48.460 --> 15:51.040
It was a bit of an extravagant measure,

15:51.040 --> 15:53.920
but I very much desired to
meet you, King Femud.

15:55.630 --> 15:57.830
What's this about?

15:58.960 --> 16:01.040
I have come to apologize.

16:02.080 --> 16:04.500
Apologize?

16:04.920 --> 16:05.920
Yes.

16:08.330 --> 16:10.500
First, I present you this to you.

16:14.880 --> 16:19.500
I never intended to have Donapierru attacked.

16:19.920 --> 16:25.290
However, this dunce destroyed the city
with lightning speed.

16:25.830 --> 16:31.080
All I could do was punish this ignoramus
and bring him here.

16:31.790 --> 16:37.130
As the progenitor, I sincerely apologize that
my leadership was lacking in vigilance.

16:37.790 --> 16:39.250
I don't understand.

16:39.830 --> 16:43.460
Her conduct radiates her excellent
upbringing and disposition,

16:43.460 --> 16:45.710
and her voice is brimming with compassion.

16:45.710 --> 16:48.330
Is she truly a dragon?

16:49.210 --> 16:54.330
She said she made the world stand still,
but I can still move.

16:54.750 --> 16:56.710
And if the barrier is still functioning...

16:57.290 --> 17:00.830
I have a way to attack her!

17:01.960 --> 17:04.330
But that's not an option.

17:04.330 --> 17:09.630
Even if I killed her, it would result in
an all-out war with the Blood of the Wing,

17:09.630 --> 17:11.880
and my kingdom would be destroyed.

17:11.880 --> 17:16.630
The Winged Monarch is personally presenting
her subordinate's head and apologizing to me.

17:16.630 --> 17:19.500
I must accept her apology.

17:20.630 --> 17:23.380
Raise your head, Winged Monarch.

17:23.380 --> 17:26.130
Your remorse has been
more than sufficiently conveyed.

17:26.130 --> 17:28.830
I appreciate your benevolent words.

17:29.330 --> 17:32.420
Nevertheless, what transpired
was unfortunate.

17:32.830 --> 17:36.750
I had hoped the people of Lese
wouldn't feel frightened of their deaths.

17:36.750 --> 17:40.380
I only wanted them to tranquilly disappear.

17:40.630 --> 17:42.130
Huh?

17:42.630 --> 17:45.130
I'm so aggrieved that didn't come to pass...

17:45.130 --> 17:46.710
W-wait!

17:46.710 --> 17:48.670
You're not making sense!

17:48.670 --> 17:52.380
Earlier you said you didn't intend
to attack Donapierru!

17:52.380 --> 17:54.380
There's no doubt that's what you said!

17:54.380 --> 17:58.250
Yes, I had no intention of
attacking Donapierru.

17:58.250 --> 18:01.330
But even so, this country must be destroyed.

18:03.460 --> 18:06.710
Because God decreed it so.

18:07.250 --> 18:09.170
God?

18:10.250 --> 18:15.500
That's why I had been secretly making
preparations for the country's annihilation.

18:16.000 --> 18:21.830
However, chaos is inevitable now that
one city has already been destroyed.

18:22.170 --> 18:25.630
Many people will certainly try to
take refuge abroad.

18:25.880 --> 18:27.880
I can't allow that.

18:28.380 --> 18:33.080
I've already issued an order to attack
the towns near the country's border.

18:33.540 --> 18:36.170
Not a single soul will be permitted to leave.

18:36.880 --> 18:38.920
Order them to stop!

18:39.170 --> 18:40.380
I cannot do that.

18:40.380 --> 18:43.080
Do you want to go to war against my country?

18:43.080 --> 18:44.630
No, it won't come to that.

18:44.630 --> 18:47.250
It will be a one-sided bloodbath.

18:47.250 --> 18:49.830
I'm infinitely sorry for that.

18:50.170 --> 18:52.000
Are negotiations on the table?

18:52.000 --> 18:53.170
No.

18:56.790 --> 18:59.330
That's why, King Femud, I'm here to ask-

18:59.330 --> 19:01.000
Then I have no other option.

19:01.000 --> 19:04.290
I've made up my mind!

19:21.630 --> 19:25.290
The Solar Safeguard has been
converted into a weapon!

19:26.040 --> 19:28.040
You shall perish here!

19:28.380 --> 19:30.080
Wicked queen of the dragons!

19:39.540 --> 19:42.710
That I cannot permit, King Femud.

19:42.920 --> 19:46.500
We cannot allow you to
aim your fangs at our monarch.

19:49.630 --> 19:53.000
Thank you for trying to protect me, Nebulim.

19:53.000 --> 19:55.830
I-it was nothing! J-just doing my job!

19:57.580 --> 20:02.750
I suppose you have no gratitude
for this old fogy, my Queen?

20:02.750 --> 20:07.000
I don't recall telling you
to kill him, Elder Borgius.

20:07.000 --> 20:10.710
Naturally. I made sure to keep him alive.

20:13.920 --> 20:16.540
I left him alive in a cadaverous state.

20:16.540 --> 20:20.880
When you get old, you get your kicks
out of perfecting techniques like this.

20:21.130 --> 20:23.290
I despise brutality.

20:24.080 --> 20:26.670
Heed me time, and return.

20:42.880 --> 20:44.000
King Femud?

20:44.250 --> 20:45.380
King Femud?

20:47.420 --> 20:50.290
My subordinate committed
a serious impropriety.

20:50.290 --> 20:53.040
Again, I offer my sincerest apologies.

20:53.040 --> 20:56.380
Was I just dead?

20:56.380 --> 20:58.670
How am I alive?

20:59.960 --> 21:01.880
Do not fret.

21:01.880 --> 21:07.080
I turned back time to the state your body
was in before it was maimed.

21:09.210 --> 21:11.830
Do I frighten you?

21:12.380 --> 21:16.420
Are you a god?

21:16.420 --> 21:17.920
No.

21:17.920 --> 21:20.420
I am nothing more than God's servant.

21:20.420 --> 21:26.170
And your god desires
the downfall of my country?

21:27.330 --> 21:29.170
King Femud Lese.

21:29.420 --> 21:33.250
It won't take long for the fear of death
to overtake this country.

21:33.630 --> 21:36.080
There is no way to escape
from your deaths.

21:36.080 --> 21:38.630
That is God's will.

21:38.630 --> 21:40.290
It is fate.

21:41.500 --> 21:45.670
But you can escape from fear and torment.

21:46.830 --> 21:50.540
King of Lese, I would like your cooperation.

21:50.880 --> 21:55.960
You can help make sure that as many people
as possible die without suffering.

21:55.960 --> 21:57.630
You're the king.

21:57.630 --> 21:59.670
I'd like you to lead your people.

22:00.250 --> 22:02.580
If you hold your people dear,

22:02.580 --> 22:05.500
please take my hand.
